    {
      "id": "claim_dd69dd47fa944ce9b1a10d744ccc1f76",
      "statement": "Configured Triton failures must not silently downgrade to PyTorch: the project explicitly requires a visible error for missing Triton, compilation failure, or runtime failure, while the normal default path remains raw PyTorch `\"stacked\"` dispatch.",
